OL,4,G0000FDance Sounds of the 90s with
OL,5,     FVernon Kay
OL,6,     GThe 90s dance floor was a place
OL,7,     Gto dream, fantasise and lose
OL,8,     Gyourself to the music. Vernon
OL,9,     Gmixes up the best dream-themed
OL,10,     Gtunes from La Bouche, Mariah
OL,11,     GCarey, D:Ream and Baby D.
